    {
      "source": "Note that as of 4.2 this method accepts a <code>headers</code> parameter.",
      "translation": "注意，自 4.2 版本起，此方法接受一个 `<code>headers</code>` 参数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "In particular since from a client perspective there is no difference\nbetween XHR and XHR streaming, an <code>XhrTransport</code> could do both.",
      "translation": "特别是从客户端角度来看，XHR 与 XHR 流式传输之间没有区别，因此一个 `<code>XhrTransport</code>` 可以同时实现这两种功能。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Typically an <code>XhrTransport</code> is used as \"XHR streaming\" first and\nthen, if that fails, as \"XHR\". In some cases however it may be helpful to\nsuppress XHR streaming so that only XHR is attempted.",
      "translation": "通常，<code>XhrTransport</code> 首先用作\"XHR 流式传输”，如果失败则作为\"XHR\"使用。但在某些情况下，抑制 XHR 流式传输可能很有帮助，以便仅尝试 XHR。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "By default this property is set to <code>false</code> which means both\n\"XHR streaming\" and \"XHR\" apply.",
      "translation": "默认情况下，此属性设置为<code>false</code>，这意味着同时启用\"XHR 流式传输”和\"XHR\"。",
      "count": 2
    },
